Changelog: 17-10-2026 07:30:38

Fixed. The app's folder in the suite is apps/ncgui (was apps/bazzite-netcatgui) and its package is netcat_gui
(was bazzite_netcatgui): the suite's naming convention (owner, 17-10-2026), a short folder name and the package
named after the app without the Bazzite prefix. With the folder go its key in the portal, its chapter of the
wiki (apps/ncgui/), its installer test and its release tags: ncgui-v<x.y.z> from the next release on, which is
also what the app's update check looks for. The installed app keeps its name, its launcher bazzite-netcatgui,
its settings and its folders; the portal moves its record of the installed copy to the new key.

